        "original_id": "71cd83e3-3fce-51cb-a263-69be1330f582",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Honeymoon Academy, Sex and the City\n- People: Kim Cattrall, Robert Hays, Samantha Jones\n- Awards: Emmy Awards, Golden Globe Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Honeymoon Academy, also titled For Better or For Worse, is a 1990 American comedy-drama film.\n- Robert Hays and Kim Cattrall starred in Honeymoon Academy.\n- Kim Cattrall played Samantha Jones in the HBO romantic comedy series Sex and the City from 1998 to 2004.\n- Kim Cattrall received five Emmy Award nominations and four Golden Globe Award nominations for Sex and the City.\n- Kim Cattrall won the 2002 Golden Globe Award for Best Supporting Actress for Sex and the City.",
